3:1 “And to the Angel of the Church of Sardis write : Thus says he who has the seven spirits of God and the seven stars : I know your works , that you have a name which is alive , but you are dead .
For I do not find your works to be full in the sight of my God .
But if you will not be vigilant , I will come to you like a thief , and you will not know at what hour I will come to you .
And these shall walk with me in white , because they are worthy .
And I will not delete his name from the Book of Life .
3:6 Whoever has an ear , let him hear what the Spirit says to the Churches .
For you have little power , and you have observed my word , and you have not denied my name .
