Say this : Stand and prepare yourself !
46:16 He has multiplied those in ruin , and each man has fallen beside his neighbor .
46:20 Egypt is like a stately and finely-formed calf .
46:21 Her hired hands also , who move within her midst , like fatted calves have been turned back , and they have fled at the same time , and they are not able to stand firm .
46:24 The daughter of Egypt has been confounded , and she has been delivered into the hand of the people of the north .
46:26 And I will give them over to the hand of those who seek their lives , and into the hand of Nebuchadnezzar , the king of Babylon , and into the hand of his servants .
For I will consume all the nations to which I have cast you out .
47:1 The word of the Lord that came to Jeremiah , the prophet , against the Philistines , before Pharaoh struck Gaza .
The fathers have not looked back for the sons , because of feebleness of hands ,
Ashkelon has been silenced , along with the remnant of their valley .
47:7 But how can it find rest , when the Lord has ordered it against Ashkelon and against its maritime regions , and when a task has been appointed to it there ?
Announce an outcry for her little ones .
And Chemosh will go into captivity : his priests and his leaders together .
And its cities will become desolate and uninhabited .
And he has not been transferred from vessel to vessel , nor has he gone into the transmigration .
48:16 The passing away of Moab draws near and arrives .
48:20 Moab has been confounded , because he has been conquered .
Announce it in Arnon : Moab has been devastated ,
48:24 and upon Kerioth , and upon Bozrah , and upon all the cities of the land of Moab , those far away and those nearby .
Because of your own words , then , which you have spoken against him , you will be led away captive .
48:29 We have listened to the arrogance of Moab ; he is very proud : his exaltation , and arrogance , and pride , and the loftiness of his heart .
And I have taken the wine from the winepresses .
48:35 And I will take away from Moab , says the Lord , the one who makes offerings in exalted places , and the one who sacrifices to his gods .
For he has done more than he was able , yet still they have perished .
All the hands will be bound together , and there will be haircloth on every back .
For I have crushed Moab like a useless vessel , says the Lord .
How is it that Moab has cast down his neck and been confounded ?
And in that day , the heart of the strong ones of Moab will be like the heart of a woman giving birth .
For he has been glorified against the Lord .
48:44 Whoever flees from the terror will fall into the pit .
For I will lead over Moab the year of their visitation , says the Lord .
For a fire has gone forth from Heshbon , and a flame from the midst of Sihon , and it will devour the portion of Moab , and the top of the head of the sons of tumult .
You have been ruined , O people of Chemosh !
48:47 But I will convert the captivity of Moab in the last days , says the Lord.” Such are the judgments of Moab thus far .
Or is there no heir for him ?
49:2 Therefore , behold , the days are approaching , says the Lord , when I will cause the noise of battle to be heard over Rabbah of the sons of Ammon .
For Ai has been devastated .
For Milcom will be led into the transmigration : his priests and his leaders together .
Your valley has flowed away , O delicate daughter , for you had confidence in your treasures , and you were saying , ‘Who can approach me ? ’
49:6 And after this , I will cause the captives of the sons of Ammon to return , says the Lord.”
Their wisdom has become useless .
49:9 If those who gather grapes had passed by you , would they not have left behind a cluster ?
His offspring has been devastated , with his brothers and his neighbors , and he himself will not exist .
I will make sure that they live .
49:12 For thus says the Lord : “Behold , those who judged that they would not drink the cup , will certainly drink .
You will not be released as if innocent .
49:14 I have heard a report from the Lord , and an legate has been sent to the nations : ‘Gather yourselves together , and go forth against her , and let us rise up to battle.’
49:16 Your arrogance has deceived you , by the pride of your heart , you who live in the caverns of the rock and who strive to take hold of the height of the hill .
49:18 Just as Sodom and Gomorrah and their neighbors were overthrown , says the Lord : there will not be a man living there , and no son of man will tend it .
For I will cause him to rush against her suddenly .
For who is like me ?
And who is that pastor who can withstand my countenance ?
Certainly , the little ones of the flock will cast them down , unless they scatter them with their habitation .
The outcry of their voice has been heard at the Red Sea .
For they have heard a most grievous report .
Because of anxiousness , they were not able to rest .
She has been turned to flight .
Anguish and sorrows have seized her , like a woman giving birth .
49:27 And I will kindle a fire at the wall of Damascus , and it will devour the defensive walls of Ben-hadad.”
For Nebuchadnezzar , the king of Babylon , has undertaken a counsel against you , and he has devised plans against you .
They have neither gates nor bars .
49:32 And their camels will be a spoil , and the multitude of their cattle will be a prey .
And from all their confines , I will lead great destruction over them , says the Lord .
No man will abide there , nor will a son of man tend it.”
And I will scatter them into all these winds .
49:37 And I will cause Elam to be terrified before their enemies and in the sight of those who seek their life .
And I will send the sword after them , until I consume them .
50:1 The word that the Lord has spoken about Babylon and about the land of the Chaldeans , by the hand of Jeremiah the prophet .
Say this : ‘Babylon has been captured .
And there will be no one who may live within it , from man even to beast .
50:4 In those days and in that time , says the Lord , the sons of Israel will advance , they and the sons of Judah together .
50:5 They will ask the way to Zion ; their faces will be set toward this place .
They have crossed from mountain to hill .
For it is they who have sinned against the Lord , the beauty of justice , and against the Lord , the hope of their fathers.’
And be like young goats before the flock .
And they will be prepared against her , and from there she will be taken .
50:11 For you exult and you speak great things , plundering my inheritance .
50:12 Your mother has been exceedingly shamed , and she who bore you has become equal to the dust .
Every one who passes by Babylon will be stupefied and will hiss over all her wounds .
Before the face of the sword of the dove , each one will turn back to his people , and every one will flee to his own land .
The lions have driven him away .
And last , this Nebuchadnezzar , the king of Babylon , has taken away his bones .
50:20 In those days and at that time , says the Lord , the iniquity of Israel will be sought , and there will be none .
For I will be forgiving to them , whom I will leave behind .
Scatter and destroy whatever has been left behind them , says the Lord , and act according to all that I have instructed you .
50:25 The Lord has opened his storehouse , and he has brought forth the instruments of his wrath .
50:26 Advance against her from the furthest regions !
Take stones from the road , and gather them into piles , and destroy her .
50:28 It is the voice of those who are fleeing and of those who have escaped from the land of Babylon : to announce in Zion the revenge of the Lord our God , the revenge of his Temple .
Stand together against her all around , and let no one escape .
In accord with all that she has done , do to her .
50:35 A sword is for the Chaldeans , says the Lord , and for the inhabitants of Babylon , and for her leaders , and for her wise ones .
A sword is for her strong ones , who will be afraid .
And they will be like women .
50:40 Just as the Lord overthrew Sodom and Gomorrah , and their neighboring towns , says the Lord , no man will live there , and a son of man will not tend it .
And many kings will rise up from the ends of the earth .
They are cruel and merciless .
50:43 The king of Babylon has heard the report about them , and his hands have been weakened .
50:44 Behold , he will ascend like a lion from the arrogance of the Jordan to the robust beauty .
And who will be the elect one , whom I may appoint over her ?
And who can endure me ?
” 50:45 Because of this , listen to the counsel of the Lord , which he has conceived in his mind against Babylon , and to his thoughts , which he has devised against the land of the Chaldeans : “Certainly the little ones of the flocks will pull them down , unless their habitation will have been destroyed with them .
Do not spare her young men .
51:4 And the slain will fall in the land of the Chaldeans , and the wounded in its regions .
He himself will repay her , in her turn .
Wail over her !
For her judgment has reached even to the heavens , and has been lifted up even to the clouds .
The Lord has raised up the spirit of the kings of the Medes .
For this is the vengeance of the Lord , the vengeance of his temple .
51:13 You who live above many waters , rich in treasures : your end has arrived , your measure has been cut short .
51:15 The One who made the earth by his strength , who prepared the world by his wisdom , and who stretched out the heavens by his prudence :
51:19 The portion of Jacob is not like their portion .
