His desire to clarify faith issues on the web was the major force behind its development.
He has a Masters degree in divinity from Saint Vincent College and a Bachelor’s degree in business management from Robert Morris University.
Lucy posts the daily readings for 2fish.co, which are automatically converted to emails and sent to those on the mailing list.
Lucy’s interests include running, exercising, shopping, her dogs, and traveling.
