12:6 In their sight , you shall be carried on shoulders , you shall be carried in the dark .
For I have appointed you as a portent for the house of Israel.”
I brought out my supplies in the daytime , like the supplies of one who is moving far away .
And I went out in the dark , and I was carried on shoulders , in their sight .
They will dig through the wall , so that they may lead him away .
And there he shall die .
