13:3 Thus says the Lord God : Woe to the foolish prophets , who are following their own spirit , and who see nothing .
13:5 You have not gone up against the adversary , and you have not established a wall for the house of Israel , so as to stand in battle on the day of the Lord .
And they continued to affirm what they said .
13:9 And my hand will be over the prophets who are seeing emptiness and divining lies .
Neither shall they enter into the land of Israel .
13:11 Say to those who spread mortar without mixing , that it will fall apart .
13:14 And I will destroy the wall that you have covered without tempering it .
And it will fall and be consumed in its midst .
13:15 And I will fulfill my indignation against the wall , and against those who cover it without mixing the mortar , and I will say to you : The wall is no more , and those who covered it are no more :
13:17 And as for you , son of man , set your face against the daughters of your people , who prophesy from their own heart .
13:18 and say : Thus says the Lord God : Woe to those who sew together little pillows under every forearm , and who make little cushions for the heads of every stage of life , in order to capture souls .
13:19 And they violated me among my people , for the sake of a handful of barley and a fragment of bread , so that they would kill the souls that should not die , and enliven the souls that should not live , lying to my people who believe in falsehoods .
13:22 For by deception you have caused the heart of the just to grieve , whom I would not sadden .
13:23 Therefore , you shall not see emptiness , and you shall not divine divinations , any more .
And you shall know that I am the Lord.”
14:1 And men among the elders of Israel came to me , and they sat down before me .
14:3 “Son of man , these men have placed their uncleanness in their hearts , and they have stationed the scandal of their iniquities before their face .
14:4 Because of this , speak to them , and you shall say to them : Thus says the Lord God : The man , the man of the house of Israel , who places his uncleanness in his heart , and who stations the scandal of his iniquities before his face , and who approaches a prophet , so as to inquire of me through him : I , the Lord , will respond to him in accord with the multitude of his uncleannesses ,
14:6 Because of this , say to the house of Israel : Thus says the Lord God : Be converted , and withdraw from your idols , and turn your faces away from all your abominations .
14:8 And I will set my face against that man , and I will make him an example and a proverb .
And you shall know that I am the Lord .
And I will extend my hand over him , and I will wipe him away from the midst of my people , Israel .
In accord with the iniquity of the one who inquires , so shall the iniquity of the prophet be .
Instead , may they be my people , and may I be their God , says the Lord of hosts.”
14:13 “Son of man , when a land will have sinned against me , so that it transgresses grievously , I will extend my hand over it , and I will crush the staff of its bread .
14:19 Then , if I also send the pestilence upon that land , and I pour out my indignation upon it with blood , so that I take away from it both man and beast ,
14:21 For thus says the Lord God : Even though I will send upon Jerusalem my four most grievous judgments , sword and famine and harmful beasts and pestilence , so that I destroy from it both man and beast ,
Behold , they will enter to you , and you will see their way and their accomplishments .
14:23 And they shall console you , when you see their ways and their accomplishments .
15:2 “Son of man , what can be made from the stalk of a vine , compared to all the plants of the woods that are among the trees of the forests ?
So how can it be useful for any work ?
How much more so , when fire has devoured it and burned it up , will nothing of it be useful ?
16:3 And you shall say : Thus says the Lord God to Jerusalem : Your root and your lineage is from the land of Canaan ; your father was an Amorite , and your mother was a Cethite .
16:7 I multiplied you like the seedling of the field .
Your breasts rose up , and your hair grew .
And I spread my garment over you , and I covered your disgrace .
16:10 And I covered you with embroidery , and I put violet shoes upon you , and I wrapped you in fine linen , and I clothed you with delicate garments .
16:12 And I put gold upon your face , and earrings in your ears , and a beautiful crown upon your head .
For you were perfected by my beauty , which I had placed upon you , says the Lord God .
16:18 And you used your multicolored vestments to cover these things .
16:20 And you took your sons and your daughters , whom you bore for me , and you immolated them to be devoured .
16:21 You have immolated my sons , and you have consecrated and delivered my sons to them .
And you distributed your feet to every passer-by .
16:27 Behold , I will extend my hand over you , and I will take away your justification .
16:29 And you multiplied your fornications in the land of Canaan with the Chaldeans .
16:30 With what can I cleanse your heart , says the Lord God , since you do all these things , the works of a woman who is a shameless prostitute ?
And you have not even been like a choosy prostitute , increasing her price ,
16:34 And it is done with you , in your fornications , contrary to the custom of women , and even after you , there will be no such fornication .
16:37 Behold , I will gather all your lovers , with whom you have united , and all those whom you have loved , together with all those whom you have hated .
And I will give you over to blood , in fury and in zeal .
And they will destroy your brothel and demolish your place of prostitution .
And they will take away the ornaments of your beauty .
16:41 And they will burn up your houses with fire , and they will carry out judgments against you in the sight of many women .
And I will rest , and no longer be angry .
Because of this , I also have delivered all your ways upon your head , says the Lord God , but I have not acted in accord with your wickedness in all your abominations .
16:45 You are your mother’s daughter , for she cast away her husband and her children .
But your younger sister , who lives to your right , is Sodom and her daughters .
16:48 As I live , says the Lord God , your sister Sodom herself , and her daughters , have not done as you and your daughters have done .
16:50 And they were exalted , and they committed abominations before me .
16:51 But Samaria has not committed even half of your sins .
16:52 Therefore , you also bear your shame , for you have exceeded your sisters with your sins , acting more wickedly than they did .
By this also , you are confounded , and you bear your disgrace , for you have justified your sisters .
16:55 And your sister Sodom and her daughters will return to their ancient state .
And you and your daughters will be returned to your ancient state .
16:57 before your malice was revealed , as it is at this time , with the reproach of the daughters of Syria and of all the daughters of Palestine , who surround you , who encircle you on every side .
16:59 For thus says the Lord God : “I will act toward you , just as you have despised the oath , so that you would make void the covenant .
And I will raise up for you an everlasting covenant .
And I will give them to you as daughters , but not by your covenant .
And it will no longer be for you to open your mouth , because of your shame , when I will have been pacified toward you over all that you have done , says the Lord God.”
