20:41 I will receive from you a fragrance of sweetness , when I will have led you away from the peoples , and gathered you from the lands into which you were dispersed .
20:42 And you shall know that I am the Lord , when I will have led you into the land of Israel , into the land about which I lifted up my hand , so that I would give it to your fathers .
20:47 And you shall say to the meridian forest : Listen to the word of the Lord .
The flame of the kindling will not be extinguished .
