You are disturbing the scepter of my son .
They have been handed over to the sword , with my people .
21:14 You therefore , O son of man , prophesy , and strike hand against hand , and let the sword be doubled , and let the sword of the slain be tripled .
21:17 And then I will clap hand against hand , and I will fulfill my indignation .
Both shall go forth from one land .
21:20 You shall appoint a way , so that the sword may approach to Rabbah of the sons of Ammon , or to Judah , into Jerusalem , greatly fortified .
