40:4 And the same man said to me : “Son of man , look with your eyes , and listen with your ears , and set your heart upon all that I will reveal to you .
Announce all that you see to the house of Israel.”
And between the chambers , there were five cubits .
40:9 And he measured the vestibule of the gate as eight cubits , and its front as two cubits .
40:10 Moreover , the chambers of the gate , toward the way of the east , were three from one side to the other .
40:11 And he measured the width of the threshold of the gate as ten cubits , and the length of the gate as thirteen cubits .
And on both sides , the border was one cubit .
40:13 And he measured the gate , from the roof of one chamber to the roof of another , twenty-five cubits in width , from door to door .
And at the front , there was a court for the gate on every side all around .
40:16 And there were slanting windows in the chambers and at their fronts , which were within the gate on every side all around .
40:17 And he led me away to the outer court , and behold , there were storerooms and a layer of pavement stones throughout the court .
40:18 And the pavement in front of the gates , along the length of the gates , was lower .
40:20 Likewise , he measured the gate of the outer court , which looked to the way of the north , to be as much in length as in width .
And its ascent was by seven steps , and a vestibule was before it .
And he measured its front and its vestibule to be the same as the measures above .
40:26 And there were seven steps to ascend to it , and a vestibule before its doors .
40:29 Its chamber , and its front , and its vestibule had the same measures .
40:30 And the vestibule all around was twenty-five cubits in length , and five cubits in width .
And he measured the gate to be in accord with the measures above .
And its windows and its vestibules all around were fifty cubits in length , and twenty-five cubits in width .
40:36 Its chamber , and its front , and its vestibule , and its windows all around were fifty cubits in length , and twenty-five cubits in width .
40:39 And at the vestibule of the gate , there were two tables on one side , and two tables on the other side , so that the holocaust , and the offering for sin , and the offering for transgression could be immolated upon them .
