40:42 Now the four tables for the holocausts were constructed of square stones : one and a half cubit in length , and one and a half cubits in width , and one cubit in height .
40:43 And their edges were one palm in width , turned inward all around .
40:44 And outside the interior gate , there were storerooms for the cantors , in the inner court , which was beside the gate that looks toward the north .
