These are the sons of Zadok , those among the sons of Levi who may draw near to the Lord , so that they may minister to him.”
And he measured the vestibule to be five cubits on one side , and five cubits on the other side .
40:49 Now the length of the vestibule was twenty cubits , and the width was eleven cubits , and there were eight steps to ascend to it .
And the gate was six cubits , and the width of the gate was seven cubits .
41:6 Now the side chambers were side by side , and twice thirty-three .
41:7 And there was a broad circular path , rising upward by winding , and it led to the cenacle of the temple by a circular course .
And so , from the lower parts , they rose up to the higher parts , in the center .
41:9 And the width of the exterior wall for the side chambers was five cubits .
41:10 And between the storerooms , there was the width of twenty cubits , all around the house on every side .
One door was toward the way of the north , and one door was toward the way of the south .
41:13 And he measured the length of the house to be one hundred cubits , and the edifice , which was separate , with its walls , to be one hundred cubits in length .
But the floor reached even to the windows , and the windows were closed above the doors ;
41:18 And there were cherubim and palm trees wrought , and each palm tree was between one cherub and another , and every cherub had two faces .
This was depicted throughout the entire house all around .
