4:10 Jesus responded and said to her: “If you knew the gift of God, and who it is who is saying to you, ‘Give me to drink,’ perhaps you would have made a request of him, and he would have given you living water.”
From where, then, do you have living water?
4:13 Jesus responded and said to her: “All who drink from this water will thirst again.
4:18 For you have had five husbands, but he whom you have now is not your husband.
For salvation is from the Jews.
