For this cannot be, unless the apostasy will have arrived first, and the man of sin will have been revealed, the son of perdition,
2:7 For the mystery of iniquity is already at work.
2:10 and with every seduction of iniquity, toward those who are perishing because they have not accepted the love of truth, so that they may be saved.
