28:14 For thus says the Lord of hosts , the God of Israel : I have placed a yoke of iron on the neck of all these nations , so that they may serve Nebuchadnezzar , the king of Babylon .
Moreover , I have given to him even the beasts of the earth.”
The Lord has not sent you , and so you have caused this people to trust in a lie .
This year , you shall die .
28:17 And Hananiah the prophet died in that year , in the seventh month .
29:1 And these are the words of the letter which Jeremiah , the prophet , sent from Jerusalem to the remnant of the elders of the transmigration , and to the priests , and to the prophets , and to all the people , whom Nebuchadnezzar had led away from Jerusalem to Babylon ,
29:3 It was sent by the hand of Elasah , the son of Shaphan , and by Gemariah , the son of Hilkiah , whom Zedekiah , the king of Judah , sent to Babylon to Nebuchadnezzar , the king of Babylon , saying :
29:6 Take wives , and conceive sons and daughters .
And be multiplied there , and do not choose to be few in number .
For your peace will be in its peace .
And you should pay no attention to your dreams , which you are dreaming .
29:10 For thus says the Lord : When the seventy years will begin to be completed in Babylon , I will visit you .
29:11 For I know the thoughts that I think over you , says the Lord : thoughts of peace and not of affliction , so that I may give you patience and an end .
And you shall pray to me , and I will heed you .
And you will find me , when you have sought me with your whole heart .
And I will lead you back from your captivity .
And I will return you from the place to which I sent you into captivity .
29:16 For thus says the Lord , to the king who sits upon the throne of David , and to all the people who live in this city , to your brothers who have not departed with you in the transmigration :
And I will make them like the bad figs , which cannot be eaten , because they are very bad .
And I will give them over to affliction , amid all the kingdoms of the earth : as a curse , and in stupor , and with hissing , and as a disgrace among all the nations to which I have driven them out .
But you have not listened , says the Lord .
29:21 Thus says the Lord of hosts , the God of Israel , to Ahab , the son of Kolaiah , and to Zedekiah , the son of Maaseiah , who prophesy falsely to you in my name : Behold , I will deliver them into the hands of Nebuchadnezzar , the king of Babylon , and he will strike them down before your eyes .
’ 29:23 For they have acted foolishly in Israel , and they have committed adultery with the wives of their friends , and they have spoken lying words in my name , which I did not command them .
29:26 ‘The Lord has made you priest in place of Jehoiada , the priest , so that you would be the ruler in the house of the Lord over every man who raves and prophesies , to send him to the stocks and to prison .
29:32 For this reason , thus says the Lord : Behold , I will visit upon Shemaiah of Nehelam , and upon his offspring .
And he will not see the good that I will accomplish for my people , says the Lord .
And I will return them to the land which I gave to their fathers , and they will possess it.”
And why have all of their faces turned pale ?
For that day is great , and there is nothing like it .
30:8 And this shall be in that day , says the Lord of hosts : I will crush his yoke from your neck , and I will break open his bands .
30:9 Instead , they will serve the Lord their God , and David their king , whom I will raise up for them .
For behold , I will save you from a far away land , and your offspring from the land of their captivity .
And there will be no one for him to dread .
For I will bring about the consummation of all the nations , among which I have scattered you .
Instead , I will chastise you in judgment , so that you will not seem innocent to yourself.”
30:13 There is no one who may judge your judgment , so as to bandage it ; there is no useful treatment for you .
For I have wounded you with the strike of an enemy , with a cruel chastisement .
And all your enemies will be led into captivity .
And all those who prey upon you , I will offer as a prey .
For they have called you an outcast , O Zion : ‘This is she who has no one asking for her.’ ”
And the city will be built up in her heights , and the temple will be founded according to its order .
And I will multiply them , and they will not be lessened .
And I will visit against all those who trouble them .
And their prince will be led forward from their midst .
For who is the one who applies his heart , so that he may draw near to me , says the Lord ?
30:23 Behold the whirlwind of the Lord , his fury going forth , a destroying storm !
30:24 The Lord will not turn back the wrath of his indignation , until he has accomplished and completed the plan of his heart .
31:2 Thus says the Lord : “The people who had remained after the sword , found grace in the desert .
31:3 The Lord appeared to me from a distance : “And I have loved you in perpetual charity .
31:11 For the Lord has redeemed Jacob , and he has freed him from the hand of one more powerful .
And they will flow together , to the good things of the Lord , over grain , and wine , and oil , and the offspring of cattle and herds .
31:14 And I will inebriate the soul of the priests with fatness , and my people will be filled with my good things , says the Lord.”
31:16 Thus says the Lord : “Let your voice cease from crying and your eyes from tears .
And they will return from the land of the enemy .
Convert me , and I shall be converted .
I am confounded and ashamed .
Because my heart is stirred up over him , surely I will take pity on him , says the Lord .
Place yourself in bitterness .
Return , return , O virgin of Israel , to these your cities !
For the Lord has created something new upon the earth : a woman will encompass a man.”
31:24 And they will live in it : Judah together with all its cities , the farmer and those who drive the flocks .
31:27 Behold , the days are approaching , says the Lord , when I will sow the house of Israel and the house of Judah with the offspring of men and with the offspring of cattle .
31:29 In those days , they will no longer say : ‘The fathers ate a bitter grape , and the teeth of the sons have been affected.’
Each man who will have eaten a bitter grape , his own teeth will be affected .
31:32 not according to the covenant which I made with their fathers , in the day when I took them by the hand , so as to lead them away from the land of Egypt , the covenant which they nullified , though I was the ruler over them , says the Lord .
And I will be their God , and they shall be my people .
31:36 If these laws fail in my sight , says the Lord , then the offspring of Israel will also fail , so that they will not be a people in my sight for all time.”
31:38 Behold , the days are approaching , says the Lord , when a city will be built for the Lord from the tower of Hananel , even to the Gate of the Corner ;
32:1 The word that came to Jeremiah from the Lord in the tenth year of Zedekiah , the king of Judah .
32:2 It was then that the army of the king of Babylon besieged Jerusalem .
32:3 For Zedekiah , the king of Judah , had confined him , saying : “Why do you make predictions , saying : ‘Thus says the Lord : Behold , I will give this city into the hand of the king of Babylon , and he will capture it ?
Instead , he will be delivered into the hands of the king of Babylon .
So then , if you contend against the Chaldeans , you will have no success.’ ”
32:8 And in accord with the word of the Lord , Hanamel , the son of my uncle , came to me , to the entrance of the prison , and he said to me : ‘Take possession of my field , which is in Anathoth in the land of Benjamin .
32:11 And I received the signed deed of possession , and the stipulations , and the ratifications , with the exterior seals .
32:15 For thus says the Lord of hosts , the God of Israel : ‘Houses , and fields , and vineyards will be possessed still , in this land.’
No word is difficult for you .
The Lord of hosts is your name : most strong , great , and powerful !
Your eyes are open upon all the ways of the sons of Adam , so that you may repay each one according to his ways and according to the fruit of his intentions .
And you have made a name for yourself , just as in this day .
32:22 And you have given them this land , which you swore , to their fathers , that you would give to them , a land flowing with milk and honey .
But they did not obey your voice , and they did not walk in your law .
And so , all of these evils have happened to them .
And the city was given into the hands of the Chaldeans , who fight against it , before the face of the sword , and of famine , and of pestilence .
32:28 Therefore , thus says the Lord : Behold , I will deliver this city into the hands of the Chaldeans , and into the hands of the king of Babylon , and they will capture it .
32:30 For the sons of Israel and the sons of Judah , from their youth , have continually done evil in my eyes .
32:31 For this city has been a cause of fury and indignation to me , from the day when they built it , until this day , in which it will be taken away from my sight ,
32:34 And they have placed their idols in the house where my name is invoked , so that they defiled it .
32:36 And now , because of these things , thus says the Lord , the God of Israel , to this city , about which you say that it will be delivered into the hands of the king of Babylon by the sword , and by famine , and by pestilence :
And I will lead them back to this place , and I will cause them to live in confidence .
32:39 And I will give to them one heart and one way , so that they may fear me all their days , and so that it may be well with them , and with their sons after them .
And I will put my fear into their heart , so that they do not withdraw from me .
And I will plant them in this land , in truth , with my whole heart and with my whole soul .
32:43 And fields will be possessed in this land , about which you say that it is desolate because there remains neither man nor beast , and because it has been given into the hands of the Chaldeans .
