20:6 What man is there who has planted a vineyard , and has not yet caused it to be common , so that all may eat from it ?
20:8 After these things have been declared , they shall add the remainder , and shall say to the people : ‘What man is there who is overwhelmed by fear and is fainthearted ?
20:9 And when the officers of the army have become silent , and have completed their speech , each one shall prepare his unit to wage war .
