21:14 But if afterwards she does not sit well in your mind , you shall set her free .
For you have humiliated her .
21:16 and if he wishes to divide his substance among his sons : he cannot make the son of the beloved wife the firstborn , and so prefer him before the son of the hated wife .
For he is the first among his children , and the rights of the firstborn are owed to him .
